# Git checks out LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows hands the working tree CRLF
# while prettier's gate asserts LF. So `npm run gate` goes red on files the
# contributor never opened, on a fresh clone, before they have changed a line -
# and the failure says nothing about their work. CI stays green the whole time,
# because CI checks out on Linux, which makes it look like their machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left exactly as they are.
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
